# Mute: charged ollie, L + right then L again (the double tap) held about a third of a second, let go before the
# landing (grab review: ./skate strip --sheet scenarios/grabs.strips).
park lab
spawn lab_ledge
hold up 0..60
hold ollie 60..90
tap grab+right 96
tap grab 99
hold grab 101..140
run 300
expect event trickEnd{trick=Mute} within 120..200
expect no event bail
